{"unit_id":"outnever__dsh-research-first#card-zh","repo":"outnever/dsh-research-first","commit":"ec25abf698cbdec2f594178d744acb169a34d118","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-research-first**（DSH 插件，适用于 DSH agent）：它在工具执行前后和 system prompt 扩展点加入开发前调查引导。默认情况下，agent 未先调查就尝试写入、编辑或执行命令时，插件放行操作并在会话上下文中加入提醒；也可配置为请求审批或拒绝。它会在调查工具失败时提示用户说明受阻，并在连续失败后建议查阅社区反馈。适合希望减少凭记忆修改、保留提醒记录的开发流程。无需额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:60-176"]}
{"unit_id":"outnever__dsh-research-first#card-en","repo":"outnever/dsh-research-first","commit":"ec25abf698cbdec2f594178d744acb169a34d118","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**dsh-research-first** nudges DSH agents to investigate before editing. It adds guidance through tool hooks and the system prompt. Uninvestigated edits get a reminder by default; settings can request approval or deny them. Failed research triggers reminders. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:60-176"]}
