{"unit_id":"outnever__dsh-research-first#feature-soft-nudge","repo":"outnever/dsh-research-first","commit":"ec25abf698cbdec2f594178d744acb169a34d118","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"「未调查修改提醒」：agent 未调用调查工具便尝试 write、edit 或 bash 等修改工具时，默认允许操作并在执行后注入提醒；可配置为审批或拒绝。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:112-142"]}
{"unit_id":"outnever__dsh-research-first#feature-blocked-research","repo":"outnever/dsh-research-first","commit":"ec25abf698cbdec2f594178d744acb169a34d118","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"「调查受阻提示」：配置的调查工具执行失败时，插件在工具结果上下文中加入提示，要求说明受阻原因并询问用户是否继续。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:150-155"]}
{"unit_id":"outnever__dsh-research-first#feature-research-norm","repo":"outnever/dsh-research-first","commit":"ec25abf698cbdec2f594178d744acb169a34d118","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"「调查规范注入」：启用 injectNorm 后，将带版本查找、优先官方途径和说明查证受阻等建议加入 DSH system prompt。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:91-99"]}
{"unit_id":"outnever__dsh-research-first#feature-failure-community","repo":"outnever/dsh-research-first","commit":"ec25abf698cbdec2f594178d744acb169a34d118","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"「连续失败提醒」：失败次数达到 failureThreshold 后重置调查状态，并在下一次未调查的修改尝试时提醒先查社区反馈。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:157-168"]}
{"unit_id":"outnever__dsh-research-first#caveat-no-keys","repo":"outnever/dsh-research-first","commit":"ec25abf698cbdec2f594178d744acb169a34d118","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"该插件没有读取 API key、账号配置或调用外部服务的实现；提醒内容作为 plugin-sourced 消息加入会话上下文。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1-3","lib/index.js:45-55","lib/index.js:172-175"]}
